(no_connect (at 231.14 203.2) (uuid "0aae51fb-aea5-4fc4-b16d-18fb64fa9375"))
(rectangle (start 264.16 121.92) (end 405.13 227.33) (stroke (width 0.15) (type solid) (color 132 132 132 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "79ef906f-76ff-440a-a854-8fa8f95628d8"))
(text "NOTES" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 128.27 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ea053636-e6ab-4df2-8842-e58f076ef3d2"))
(text "1. Pin map (matches sketch/sketch.ino): D5 SERVO_PAN (TIM1), D6 SERVO_TILT (TIM3), D7 LASER_EN (PB2," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 133.35 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ea075a4b-d68f-42f0-9848-416cb4f8dbf8"))
(text "    TIM8, plain GPIO), D8 NEO_STRIP, D9 NEO_RING. MCU GPIO is 3.3 V, 5 V tolerant except A0/A1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "eeef3579-72e5-450c-973c-f9ca8a2bb91d"))
(text "2. R1 = (5.0 V - 2.2 V) / 20 mA = 140R, use 150R: about 19 mA, 0.05 W. If the module keeps its own" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 140.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "45441911-02b9-477b-8534-a9d88ad38c75"))
(text "    resistor the current is lower; measure before fitting." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0c994782-e8a4-42ee-92fc-489dcedbb9fd"))
(text "3. R2: gate charge peak 3.3 V / 270R = 12 mA. R3 holds Q1 off during boot and reset." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 148.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "58572e4a-3740-4234-845a-a98653a0a015"))
(text "4. LD1 is a salvaged low-power keychain laser module, output power unmeasured. Firmware switches" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c0e2d1a9-f410-4faa-ab8c-c41c1d0eafd5"))
(text "    it off after 10 s (sketch.ino and hardware.py). Never aim at people or at head height." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 156.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a9000ae2-1637-433c-bc03-903db40748fd"))
(text "5. U1 (74AHCT125, VIH 2.0 V) lifts 3.3 V data to 5 V; WS2812B needs VIH 0.7 x VDD = 3.5 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "32c62020-7d7f-4c14-8ffc-640d182c513b"))
(text "    Unused gates 3 and 4: inputs and OE to GND, outputs open. R4, R5 at the first LED." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 163.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "19e7573b-f029-4a93-9989-398eaa529442"))
(text "6. Servos (about 0.7 A stall each) and LEDs run from J1, never from the UNO Q 5 V pin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6c773f4f-0181-40b1-98bd-1d8b97e62c0c"))
(text "    J1 GND, UNO Q GND, Q1 source, servo and LED grounds are common." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 171.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3a17653c-28aa-44b9-b756-be045daee888"))
(text "7. Load budget: servos 1.4 A + LEDs 24 x 60 mA = 1.44 A + laser 0.02 A = 2.9 A worst case." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e3c2844b-7f09-4061-bafb-50627258c9c0"))
(text "8. All resistors 0.25 W 5 %. Electrolytics 10 V or more." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 266.7 179.07 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 0 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bc6337be-5edf-447c-b309-8b1ba04d35bc"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
